---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Steven Hubert: Ikon Pass founding team member and design leader at Alterra Mountain Company.">
  <section class="about">
    <div class="inset">

      <header class="head">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1 class="title">Steven Hubert.</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="body">
        <p class="lead">
          Senior Director, Digital Products &amp; Experience at Alterra Mountain
          Company. I lead the teams that design what sits between a guest and a
          mountain: the Ikon Pass online and in the app, Alterra's resort
          websites, and Mountain Powder, the platform our resorts use to report
          snow, lifts, and trails.
        </p>

        <p>
          I was on the founding team that launched the Ikon Pass in 2018, fewer
          than ten of us in a room, everyone wearing several hats. Before that, at
          Intrawest, I designed and launched two other multi-mountain passes: the
          Intrawest Passport and M.A.X. Pass.
        </p>

        <p>
          The work I love most is the start. I take what guests and resorts tell
          us and turn it into a working prototype, often in days, built with AI on
          Corduroy, the design system my team built. Good ideas reach the roadmap
          with evidence behind them. Weak ones fail fast and cheap.
        </p>

        <p>
          Before Intrawest, I spent a decade running digital programs at agencies
          in New York and Boulder, including Crispin Porter + Bogusky, Grey,
          Domani Studios, and Mondo Robot. That work won five Cannes Gold Lions.
        </p>

        <p>
          Outside work I ski, ride bikes, and make maps with lasers and 3D
          printers. Based in Denver.
        </p>

        <p>
          The long version of the CV lives on
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/stevenhubert/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn ↗</a>,
          which is also the best way to reach me.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .inset {
    max-width: var(--layout-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-inline: var(--layout-inset);
  }
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px) clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  .head {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(24px, 4vw, 36px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);
    max-width: 56rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--type-micro);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-eyebrow);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--type-h1);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .body {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .body p {
    font-size: var(--type-body);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .body .lead {
    font-size: var(--type-lede);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .body a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-alpen);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }
  .body a:hover { color: var(--color-alpen); }
</style>
